  "how": "**Install:**\n\n```powershell\npython -I tools/install_kit.py --to \"$HOME\\.claude\" test-runner\n```\n\n**Use:** Claude delegates after code changes; or ask:\n\n```text\nUse the test-runner subagent on the cart package and tell me what fails.\n```\n\nIt never fixes code: it reports, and your main conversation decides. It never says \"all tests pass\" unless the runner printed it, which is the habit the [[kit:tests-on-stop|tests-on-Stop hook]] enforces.",
