  "summary": "Pipes this branch's commits and diff to claude -p and prints a PR description. JSON output, a turn cap, a budget cap and dontAsk mode, so it cannot wander or wait for you; the cost goes to stderr. UTF-8 both ways, even in Windows PowerShell 5.1.",
